Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-test layer to your build
 II.  Build RPM for sanity ptest
III. Run sanity ptest on Linux

I. Adding the edf-ptest-coverage layer to your build
=================================================
Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer edf-ptest-coverage '

II. Build RPM for sanity ptest
=================================================
bitbake packagegroup-edf-ptest-sanity-coverage
rpm will be avilable in below path
PTEST :- $ROOT/build/tmp/deploy/rpm/cortexa72_cortexa53/
SANITY_TEST :- $ROOT/build/tmp/deploy/rpm/noarch

III. Run sanity ptest on Linux
=================================================
Check avialble tests 
ptest-runner -l
Run all avilable tests
ptest-runner 
Run selctive tests
ptest-runner test1 test2 

